OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after alleged park
OL,4,Arape
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Frape after a woman reported being
OL,8,Fsexually assaulted in a park.
OL,10,FThe alleged assault happened in
OL,11,FWestbourne Park, off Bramford Lane, in
OL,12,FIpswich at about 22:00 GMT on Tuesday.
OL,14,FSuffolk Police said a woman in her 20s
OL,15,Freported being raped and that both
OL,16,Fparties are believed to know each
OL,17,Fother.
OL,19,FA 27-year-old man was arrested and
OL,20,Freleased on police bail until 14
OL,21,FDecember.
